# Mimeoplasm exiles Grizzly Bears as it enters and gets three +1/+1 counters. Agatha's Soul Cauldron exiles Eater of the
# Dead and puts a fourth counter on it, so the Cauldron lends it the Eater's "{0}: If this creature is tapped, exile target
# creature card from a graveyard and untap this creature" (CR 613.1f). Tapped attacking, Mimeoplasm exiles the Llanowar
# Elves Bot2 discarded with that lent ability. The owner's ruling (jschibel, 2026-11-24): any ability on the card, printed,
# copied or granted, counts as "exiled with it", because Mimeoplasm did the exiling. So its copy ability may target the
# Elves, and it becomes a 4/4 Llanowar Elves.
[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Entomb
Entomb
Mimeoplasm, Revered One
Agatha's Soul Cauldron
Grizzly Bears
Eater of the Dead
Forest x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Llanowar Elves
Island x20

